# Dev harness build output — esbuild bundles that inline the whole app plus
# node_modules. `graphify update` respects .gitignore, so leaving these out of it
# indexed them as code and they became ~44% of the graph (dev/harness.js 4,049
# nodes + dev/listings.js 3,485, vs 9,198 for the entire real codebase).
# The harness *sources* (dev/*.tsx, dev/*.ts, dev/*.mjs) stay tracked on purpose.
